# cordelius

--- Duelist_Silence | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_DUELIST_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Cordelius's next main attack shoots a poison mushroom that prevents the enemy from attacking for <VALUE1> seconds.
now  Cordelius's next main attack shoots a poison mushroom that prevents the enemy from attacking for <VALUE1> seconds.
