--- Duelist_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_DUELIST_1_DESC
raw  Hitting the second mushroom to the same target as the first, deals <VALUE1>% extra damage.
now  Hitting the second mushroom to the same target as the first, deals 20% extra damage.
  VALUE1  20  -> 20

--- Duelist_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_DUELIST_2_DESC
raw  Cordelius spawns <VALUE1> mushrooms to the Shadow Realm after using his Super, healing allies and damaging enemies for <VALUE2> health on pickup.
now  Cordelius spawns 3 mushrooms to the Shadow Realm after using his Super, healing allies and damaging enemies for <VALUE2> health on pickup.
  VALUE1  3  -> 3
  VALUE2  -  -> 1410

--- Duelist_ulti | super | TID_DUELIST_ULTI_DESC
raw  Cordelius shoots a Shadow Mushroom that passes through walls and on hit transfers the target and him to the Shadow Realm for <!card.character.ultiskill.projectile.customuniquepropertyvalue.ticksasseconds> seconds. Cordelius has <!card.character.statuseffect.speedboostpercent>% higher movement speed and <!card.character.statuseffect.decreasereloadtimepercent>% faster reload speed in the Shadow Realm.
now  Cordelius shoots a Shadow Mushroom that passes through walls and on hit transfers the target and him to the Shadow Realm for 8 seconds. Cordelius has 10% higher movement speed and 20% faster reload speed in the Shadow Realm.
  card.character.ultiskill.projectile.customuniquepropertyvalue.ticksasseconds  8  -> 8
  card.character.statuseffect.speedboostpercent  10  -> 10
  card.character.statuseffect.decreasereloadtimepercent  20  -> 20
